            "modalAutoOpenDelay": 0
          },
          "modalTest": "<div class=\"mbr-section-btn\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary display-4\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#modal2\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#modal2\">Preview modal2</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary display-4\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#modal2-howtouse\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#modal2-howtouse\">How to use modal2</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"modal2-howtouse\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"modal2-howtouseLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog\" role=\"document\" style=\"height:auto\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h5 class=\"modal-title display-7\" id=\"modal2-howtouseLabel\">How to use?</h5>\n        <a href=\"\" class=\"close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body display-7\">\n        Using your new modal is very easy. Simply create a new link, then click the \"...\" tab and enter the following as custom URL:<br /><br />\n        <code>javascript:OpenModal('modal2')</code>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-secondary display-4\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">Close</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
          "modalBody": "Com sites você eleva o seu negocio para níveis estraodinarios e com modernidade não perca mais tempo e reserve já para o seu negócio.\n\nVá para a secção de contactos",
          "alias": "witsec-modal-window",
          "_tags": [
            "Extension"
          ],
          "_name": "witsec-modal-window-block",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_anchor": "witsec-modal-window-block-2d",
          "modalWindow": "<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"modal2\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"modal2Label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">  <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered\" style=\"height:auto\" role=\"document\">    <div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\">  <h5 class=\"no-anim modal-title display-7\" id=\"modal2Label\">Desenvolvimeto Web</h5>  <a href=\"#\" class=\"no-anim close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span></a></div><div class=\"modal-body display-7\" id=\"modal2_body\">Com sites você eleva o seu negocio para níveis estraodinarios e com modernidade não perca mais tempo e reserve já para o seu negócio.<br /><br />Vá para a secção de contactos</div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><div class=\"mbr-section-btn\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"no-anim btn btn-secondary display-4\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" data-dismiss=\"modal\">X</a></div></div>    </div>  </div></div><script> \ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() { \n  if(typeof jQuery === \"function\") {\n    $(\"#modal2\").on(\"hidden.bs.modal\", function () { \n      var html = $( \"#modal2_body\" ).html(); \n      $( \"#modal2_body\" ).empty(); \n      $( \"#modal2_body\" ).append(html); \n    }) \n  } else { \n      var mdw = document.getElementById(\"#modal2\") \n      mdw.addEventListener(\"hidden.bs.modal\", function(event) { \n        mdw.innerHTML = mdw.innerHTML; \n      }); \n  } \n}); \n</script>"
